> 
> ```plan
> async function main(input) {{
>   // return JSON-safe data
> }}
> ```
> The visible answer must stand on its own. A plan is optional and is executed
> separately; never claim that planned work has already happened.
> 
> Inside main, invoke registered tools with:
> 
> await tools["tool.name"]({{ ...arguments }})
